  "contracts": [
    "Selected tar/OCI/ref/stdin namespaces are separate from display labels and transient spool names. Opaque per-acquisition scope prevents foreign flatten-index attribution.",
    "image_digest/config_digest hash observed raw metadata; file digest hashes raw member bytes before decoding; config-view digest hashes its actual rendered text.",
    "layer_diff_id hashes the full uncompressed TAR stream only after EOF and successful close without cancellation. Available SHA256 rootfs diff IDs are checked; observed hashes do not authenticate compressed blob bytes or a registry signature.",
    "After source drain, finalization stamps layer metadata, recomputes keyed occurrence IDs with the same report key and assigns final-image status before deduplication.",
    "Private TAR ordinal separates index places and occurrences. JSON/SARIF preserve final-image status in summary and individual occurrences.",
    "Build instruction is raw source context and requires explicit --show-secrets. Source/registry/parser errors do not reflect raw causes.",
    "OCI metadata content-addresses are validated before cache insertion. Metadata failure remains incomplete and never certifies image/runtime/deployment state."
  ],
